{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarBottom"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents17MISOToolBarBottomV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOToolBarBottom","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOToolBarBottom","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"platforms":[{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","title":"MISOToolBarBottom"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The bottom toolbar is a kind of navigation bar component used to display leading and trailing actions"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at the bottom of the screen when supported."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarBottom"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"toolBarBottom"},{"type":"text","text":" View helper applies a SwiftUI toolbar configuration."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Platform considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Platform-considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Not available on watchOS, tvOS and macOS","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Guidelines","level":2,"anchor":"Guidelines"},{